Pipplee animation collection

All 12,361 source catalogue IDs were imported from
https://pipplee.com/api/v1/animations on 13 October 2026.

Glyph's maintainer confirmed direct permission from the Pipplee app creator
on 13 October 2026 and retains the consent conversation privately. This is
a specific, maintainer-authorized import. These files are not represented
as CC0, public domain, or covered by Glyph's MIT code licence. The upstream
API did not supply individual artist names or per-work licence records.

The app credits this collection as:
"From the Pipplee catalogue, shared with permission."

provenance.json records every source URL and SHA-256, converted clip
SHA-256, dimensions, frame count and duration. Identical converted files
share storage; every upstream ID remains a separate catalogue entry.

See docs/PIPPLEE_COLLECTION.md for conversion, verification and delivery.
